2. test_thin_band_near_plane_no_spurious_crossings — 1cm cube top=0.2500009
   (d~9e-7 within onplane_eps) must produce clean loops with 4 corners
3. test_chain_loops_no_midpoint_rectangle — 4-segment rectangle (no midpoints)
   must chain to 4 points (was 3)
4. test_chain_loops_no_midpoint_triangle — 3-segment triangle (no midpoints)
   must chain to 3 points (was dropped entirely)

## No regression on existing tests
All 14 pre-existing tests pass unchanged — the fixes only ADD vertices that
were previously dropped, and those extra vertices are collinear midpoints
that _simplify_loop removes anyway. For no-midpoint loops (the thin-band
case), the fixes correctly preserve real corners.

